From 62b7558fd4fe860372243949bc04f2a4498a5a07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Carney <tim.carney@cargt.com>
Date: Tue, 30 Sep 2025 08:39:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Autosave env when defaults are set.

WIP: Initial check-in for 00377 support.

WIP: Update device tree for 00377-00365.

WIP: Update 00377 configs.

Update target in 00377 defconfig.

WIP: Add config for 00377.

Add TARGET_IMX8MP_00377 stanza to the imx8m Kconfig.

WIP: Changes for 00377 bring-up.

WIP: Do not include security definitions for 00377.

WIP: Assign all resources to the application processor.

WIP: REMOVE - Add debug printing.

WIP: Update settings for proper UART in U-Boot for 00377.

WIP: Fix dtb specification for U-Boot for 00377.
